{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1812.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"992a073b4b8e324bb78e9c7d2f72b7f30d757f483c7d228f6498849d7fdb983c","ja":"雪女の正体","zh":"雪女的真面目貌","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1812.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"5078c7e3c797d4a025de28fdb994e6acff6be3b535e7bb008a65ecbd93774432","ja":"そろそろ撮影終了の時間ですよね。\n残念だけど、さすがに疲れたし仕方ないかな……？","zh":"差不多该到拍摄结束的时间了吧。\n虽然有点遗憾，但确实也累了，没办法吧……？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1812.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"17cc107100dc4c93e41d34ab95616b6f37c7b9d814bfa6cb71c0dc68c094cd45","ja":"「あ、ちょっと待ってください。SNSに\n新しい書き込みがありました。ご覧ください」","zh":"啊，请稍等一下。SNS上有新的帖子，请看。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1812.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"07424c08b412d27e7154838ed6c8fa2d7aedc776bc68f651db497f15e24d17b8","ja":"「また雪女を見た」……写真もありますね。\n……はっ。こ、これは……。","zh":"“又看到雪女了”……还有照片呢。\n……啊，这、这是……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1812.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"15e4274a36c4edc08a698f5cf55af1fc9ae247d7e6fc7b1cc8f1370dafeab23a","ja":"だいぶぼやけてるけど……\nここに写ってるの、可憐ちゃんだよね！？","zh":"虽然已经模糊得很厉害了……\n照片里的是可怜吧！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1812.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"48cf1754c2dc8a26114b16d7116a6adbb433bd8c25e4ad2201c8f1652dd219ec","ja":"あ……こ、これ……さっき、\n逃げてった人が、撮ったんじゃあ……。","zh":"啊……这、这个……刚才那个逃走的人拍的吧……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1812.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"ef31ed5e7c46923049c01444b7afacf0804f79034c9285eeb56f0e7e91367820","ja":"じゃあ、ワタシたちがさがしてた\n雪女って……カレンだったノ～！？","zh":"那么，我们一直在找的雪女……原来是卡莲吗～！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1812.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"e8bed9c38ab6f0d3f9a1a31494c47650791026b5be60193dd7ad878e4cf922b6","ja":"えっ…………ええ～っ！？","zh":"欸…………诶——！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1812.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"e204977733f216e51bde21e8fffe5088e3e328eae119566444117dd4961739b2","ja":"「…………はい、いい表情撮れました！\n実は、ドッキリだったんです！」","zh":"“…………好，拍到很棒的表情了！\n其实，这是整蛊啦！”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1812.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"0fb09ab2df639c3908e327a64bc73a30002e75bc89ceff05635e98e47b173e71","ja":"えっ、じゃあ、雪女の噂もウソなノ～！？","zh":"咦，那雪女的传闻也是骗人的吗～！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1812.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"b32f3cc86772639c28a576c8af092c300bbcf24db0662c11d420fdf78ce5bf44","ja":"「いえ、調査依頼や、絶世の美女の雪女の噂は\n本当にあったんですが……」","zh":"“不，调查委托和绝世美女雪女的传闻，确实都是真的……”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1812.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"9166c968637d5a3529db21d8b1786c683e7f32ee2eb869a96e8500f6c9351641","ja":"「調べたらどうも、篠宮さんのことらしく。\nじゃあ、本人に真相を突き止めてもらおうと」","zh":"调查后发现，好像是关于篠宫小姐的。\n所以就想让她本人查明真相。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1812.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"5885e2cdc12255e10007ef828f3238ad729fc2e4b936040c10adc765a69e8a84","ja":"そ、そういえば……前にこのあたりを、\n家族旅行で歩いたような……で、でも雪女って……？","zh":"说、说起来……以前好像和家人来这附近旅行过……但、但是雪女……？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1812.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"b51ace05ff807a1e6f2f2fea9a2997e87209e25b66a583812c1ab1afa97ca54b","ja":"うんうん、わかるヨ～！\nカレンは神秘的でキレイだもんネ♪","zh":"嗯嗯，我懂的啦～！\n卡莲既神秘又漂亮嘛♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1812.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"1e2dee421e21bd874b8a18843dff9c5d3bde13fee6fd50694b06d7a70cbfe1be","ja":"そ、そんな……ほ、褒めすぎです……！","zh":"这、这样……您、您夸得太过头了……！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1812.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"10b74c1c8b152a349708b573a5933d671868ebf3b80306eacfbf7e01a5ffc0e2","ja":"「いやいや！　この世のものとは思えない美しさで、\n雪女と思われたのも納得です！」","zh":"“不不！这美得简直不像人世间之物，被误认为是雪女也就不奇怪了！”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1812.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"78dd93edb43636fb069542e40b4ef390284a5e20858b2a47ab02b310909ee70c","ja":"い、いえ……わ、私……本当に……\nめっそうもなくて……し、失礼します～！","zh":"不、不是……我、我真的……太不敢当了……那、那我先失陪了～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1812.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"4eb8ade2b155c5d33026f737788d5619905d313922e3f1dccdd7314ab09d5c2f","ja":"わぁ！？　カレン！？\nどこに行くノ～！？","zh":"哇！？　卡莲！？\n你要去哪儿～！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1812.unity3d","item_key":"commands[35].text","source_sha256":"d3f64138fd8f0a60082fd9ae2421981f8abb41c4bb8ec761b4eb2cb87a69cef4","ja":"……行ってしまいました。\nどんどん山の方に向かっています。","zh":"……已经走掉了。\n正不断往山里走去。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1812.unity3d","item_key":"commands[36].text","source_sha256":"4100e1aed40e23e937690d7840cc01105f96e9e3e8c8fd63adb31b728a5d67ae","ja":"わ、私たちも追いかけなきゃ！\n待って～！　可憐ちゃ～ん！？","zh":"我、我们也得追上去才行！\n等等～！可怜～～！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
